          "Title": "Sec. 101-1. - How Code designated and cited.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               The ordinances embraced in the following chapters and sections shall constitute and\n               be designated the \"Revised Code of the Consolidated City and County,\" and may be so\n               cited.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (G. O. 68, 1988, § 6)\n               </p></div>",
